### Quick Checklist Before Launch

- ✅ All core features implemented and tested.  
- ✅ Responsive design passes Lighthouse > 90.  
- ✅ Accessibility score > 90.  
- ✅ CI pipeline builds and deploys automatically.  
- ✅ Error monitoring (Sentry) is live.  
- ✅ Analytics tracking is set up.  

Once you tick all boxes, you’re ready to roll out your new frontend! 🚀

Feel free to ask if you’d like deeper dives into any specific part—whether it’s setting up a particular component, configuring a CI workflow, or optimizing performance. Happy coding!
